      <a href="https://doi.org/10.1071/WF12149" rel="noopener">doi:10.1071/WF12149</a></li>
      <li id="ref-short2022"><span class="ref-key">[short2022fpafod]</span> Short, Karen C. (2022).
      Spatial wildfire occurrence data for the United States, 1992&ndash;2020 [FPA_FOD_20221014].
      6th Edition. Fort Collins, CO: Forest Service Research Data Archive.
      <a href="https://doi.org/10.2737/RDS-2013-0009.6" rel="noopener">doi:10.2737/RDS-2013-0009.6</a></li>
      <li id="ref-nclimdiv"><span class="ref-key">[nclimdiv]</span> Vose, R.S., et&nbsp;al. (2014).
      NOAA Monthly U.S. Climate Divisional Database (nClimDiv), state-level PDSI, temperature, and
